@startuml Club Control Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Club control — calendar rules and weekly status

actor "Admin / Leader" as Client
participant ClubControlController as Controller
participant ClubControlService as Service
participant AcademicWeekService as Week
database "MySQL\nClubControlRepository" as Repository
participant "Indicators / Notification services" as Output

alt Manage academic periods or exceptions (admin)
  Client -> Controller : CRUD /club-control/periods or exceptions
  Controller -> Service : validated DTO
  Service -> Repository : validate overlap and persist
  Service -> Output : announce new exception in background
  Service --> Client : response DTO
else Check week, dashboard or weekly summary
  Client -> Controller : GET check/dashboard/weekly-summary
  Controller -> Service : year, academic week and filters
  Service -> Week : resolve period and academic boundaries
  Service -> Repository : aggregate clubs, children and pagelas
  Repository --> Service : scoped weekly data
  Service -> Output : derive status and indicators
  Service --> Client : summary DTO
end

note over Service, Repository
  Events read getCalendarRules(): active periods + exceptions.
  No period or a week outside it produces empty operational results.
end note
@enduml
